&h=200&s=798b6654255d1a1d5e5c810924aae021 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f25391d1/uploads/origins/6db264be-4559-48ae-b288-0e20abfb6745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cd59a9740e8758c3a2d26df39f284bfc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f25391d1/uploads/origins/6db264be-4559-48ae-b288-0e20abfb6745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cd59a9740e8758c3a2d26df39f284bfc, https://si.imgix.net/f25391d1/uploads/origins/6db264be-4559-48ae-b288-0e20abfb6745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b3d13eae5d0d48e5025173934eba8b3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f25391d1/uploads/origins/6db264be-4559-48ae-b288-0e20abfb6745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e828e8bb9654ec09af1736ebcb18ae73 3x"}, "body": "hello! your art is so pretty! i would love if you would draw my character!\n\n- doctor.\n- 38 years old. \n- heterochromia (right eye is red, left eye is green).\n- long scar over his right eye.\n- two beauty marks, one under each eye. \n- often seen with bruises and bandages across his body.\n- hands are always gloved, and he wears a thick black choker around his neck to conceal a scar.\n- has a tattoo of black flower petals on his right arm\n- personality: calm and serene. he seems warm and kind. gentle aura. always smiling. he is actually quite the apathetic person who has endured many losses of loved ones and a lot of grief in his past, but he pretends to be kind because he does not think he deserves to grieve.\n- imagery: gingko leaves, sparrows, autumn, bones/ribcages, scalpels\n\nhe is from a post-apocalyptic setting, and lives in a city that is recovering from a near calamity. while the city itself is still \"modernized,\" he worked for some time as a black market surgeon.\n\nthank you!\n\nhttps://